Modifications by the LazyClaw project:
    - Profile directory routed through `lazyclaw.config` so the MCP shares the
      same Brave/Chrome profile as the rest of LazyClaw (single login,
      shared cookies).
    - CDP port resolution honors the `LAZYCLAW_CDP_PORT` environment variable.
    - Package made discoverable via `python -m upwork_mcp` (added __main__.py)
      to match LazyClaw's BUNDLED_MCPS auto-register pattern.

All upstream tools (search jobs, proposals, messages, contracts, profile,
work diary) preserved unchanged.
